            "id": "20260808A07KI900",
            "title": "杉杉股份刚易主安徽国资，又遭云南国资近20亿债务诉讼，郑氏三代均牵涉其中",
            "image": "https://inews.gtimg.com/news_ls/OvUkguTqbNzUpDNRmEanhEEO3bMERngwV2cb-FUrefa1YAA_870492/0",
            "link": "https://new.qq.com/rain/a/20260808A07KI900",
            "author": "千锤百炼",
            "pub_date": "2026-08-08 13:08:00",
            "description": "<div class=\"rich_media_content\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;text-align:justify\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"margin-top:8px;visibility:visible\"><section class=\"js_darkmode__0\" data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);outline:0px;visibility:visible;white-space:normal\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:transparent;outline:0px;visibility:visible\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:transparent\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:transparent\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:transparent;text-align:left;visibility:visible\"><p></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">8月6日，<span dt-eid=\"\" dt-params=\"\"><span class=\"qnt-link\"><span class=\"qnt-link-text\">杉杉股份</span></span></span>公告旗下上海杉杉锂电、云南杉杉卷入昆明中院民间借贷案，涉案总额约19.54亿元，开庭时间定在10月9日。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.034em\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">原告是四家云南地方国资平台，要求宁波青刚投资、杉杉控股及两家上市公司子公司归还17.78亿元本金，叠加利息、违约金合计近19.54亿元；同时要求郑驹承担连带责任，周婷、郑嘉博在继承郑永刚遗产范围内偿债。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.034em\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">上市公司表示，两家子公司并未签署涉事借款协议、未使用涉案资金，原告追责缺乏法律依据，公司将应诉维权。除本次大案外，近一年公司还有多起纠纷：21件已结案涉资2.32亿元，17件未结案涉资7.86亿元，历史债务问题集中暴露。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.034em\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">杉杉股份由郑永刚创立，主营锂电材料与偏光片。2023年郑永刚猝逝后，其子郑驹与遗孀周婷争夺控制权，企业治理混乱，银行抽贷、债务违约接踵而至，</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">2024年，杉杉股份出现自1996年上市以来首次年度亏损，归母净利润亏损3.67亿元。2025年杉杉集团进入合并破产重整，首轮民营投资人方案未通过宣告失败。</span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.034em\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">2026年安徽皖维集团联合宁波金资以不超71.56亿元完成重整，皖维合计持有 21.88%表决权，实控人变为安徽省国资委。6月股权过户完成，7月董事会全面换届，郑氏家族全员退出，朱胜利出任董事长。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.034em\"><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.5px\">公司经营层面已有明显好转，2025年扭亏盈利 4.58 亿元，今年上半年预盈7.5至9 亿元，同比大幅增长。但国资入主后股价持续走弱，近三月跌幅超25%，8月7日收盘报12.42元，巨额诉讼消息加重市场担忧。</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1.75em;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:8px;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.54px\">来源｜能见度</span></span></span></span></p><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:transparent\"><section data-exeditor-arbitrary-box=\"wrap\" style=\"background-color:transparent\"><p style=\"background-color:transparent;line-height:1.6em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.54px\">编辑｜王洁</span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p style=\"background-color:transparent;line-height:1.6em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.54px\">审核｜崔妍</span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"background-color:transparent;line-height:1.6em\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0, 0, 0)\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:0.54px\">监制｜冯永明 黄毅</span></span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p></p><div powered-by=\"qqnews_ex-editor\"></div></div>",
            "source": "qq",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-CN"
        },
